  "asked": "# Theme Editor plugin (Urgent orchestrator build `theme-editor`, model Opus) Brett Nov 2 2026 21:30 ET: theme editor plugin that lets you copy, save, load. Colour section and style section, each collapsible, with collapsible categories that list every possible token; toolbar with multiple views. Brett chose: its OWN plugin, reusing the existing Theme manager plugin's token tree through a capability service (both stay installed). Look rule: apps get appearance from axHub only; saves go to the axHub appearance document / asset@1 themes. Steps (tick each: AXF_BUILD_PROFILE=urgent node apps/console-web/plugins/build-orchestrator/orchestrator.mjs act step theme-editor <sN> done): [ ] s1 (~20m) Plugin scaffold apps/console-web/plugins/theme-editor: plugin.json, install/uninstall, Settings > Plugins > Theme editor sub-tab (level toolbar), help pack; use Theme manager's token tree via a capability service (expose it from theme-manager if missing) [ ] s2 (~30m) Colour and Style sections, collapsible, with collapsible categories listing every token (built from the asset types so new tokens show up by themselves); edit any value [ ] s3 (~25m) Copy, save, load themes (asset@1), live apply through the hub look [ ] s4 (~30m) Toolbar with multiple views (tree, grid, swatches, compare) [ ] s5 (~25m) Tests, check-theme, check-controls, plugin lifecycle check, help coverage, UI Review desktop + phone shots (--group \"theme-editor - <Mon D h:mm AM/PM>\"), PR Rules: one session, no sub-agents. Every colour, size, spacing, font, radius, border from asset tokens (--fx-*), framework controls only, no var() fallbacks. Update the Theme Editor row in _claude/THREADS.md at each step. Commit + push branch claude/theme-editor often; open the PR at the end (the push banner merges it). Watch live: Brett can watch the screen you are changing hot-render in the console. Whenever you start work on a screen or element, run `node framework/cli/axf.mjs focus <app> [route] [css-selector] --note \"<what you are changing>\"` (apps: console-web, axhub-web, amberx-droid, patches-web, walkthrough-studio, demo, framework, console, axhub-android, voicevault). Agent cap: heavy steps (pnpm/npm/vite builds, docker node:22 test runs, Playwright) share a VPS-wide lock. Run each one as `node /opt/axf/deploy/../framework/cli/agent-slots.mjs heavy -- <command>` so only a few run at once.",
